<title>UK: Reuters sees Internet revenue opportunities.</title>
<headline>Reuters sees Internet revenue opportunities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters Holdings Plc Plc said on Wednesday that Internet technology is encouraging clients to think in terms of enterprise-wide dissemination of news and prices, which creates revenue opportunities for the future.</p>
<p>&quot;We have, we believe, carved out for ourselves the position of the leading provider to those who publish news on the Internet,&quot; chief executive Peter Job said in a statement with half-year results.</p>
<p>&quot;We offer public web access to our large text databases, as well as price feeds that our customers can circulate on private intranets to their personnel outside the dealing room,&quot; Job said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
